; DRAFT Cloudflare import for eticketsgo.com - NOT COMPLETE, DO NOT IMPORT AS-IS.
; Built 2026-10-26 from public DNS (8.8.8.8) plus the SES record list the owner downloaded
; (dns-records.csv, 2026-09-08). Records only GoDaddy can show (hidden names) are missing until
; the owner's GoDaddy zone export is reconciled: see docs/release/DNS-CLOUDFLARE-PLAN.md, Step 0.
;
; Cloudflare: Add site > Free > DNS > Records > Import (BIND). After import, set EVERY record to
; "DNS only" (grey cloud) EXCEPT the apex A record, which must be "Proxied" (orange) for the
; Redirect Rule (plan Step 1, items 3-4). Nameservers are NOT switched without owner approval.
$ORIGIN eticketsgo.com.
$TTL 3600

; ---- apex ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Replaces GoDaddy forwarding (A 3.33.251.168 / 15.197.225.128). Placeholder address: the
; Cloudflare proxy answers with the 301 Redirect Rule before this address is ever used.
@                       IN A      192.0.2.1
@                       IN MX     0 eticketsgo-com.mail.protection.outlook.com.
@                       IN TXT    "v=spf1 include:spf.protection.outlook.com -all"
@                       IN TXT    "google-site-verification=7raXg0p-Nx1F26PLL1VclSW57HgbZDhbBHRoTGw-0tk"
@                       IN TXT    "v=verifydomain MS=2720010"

; ---- mail: Microsoft 365 (support@ inbox) ----------------------------------------------------
autodiscover            IN CNAME  autodiscover.outlook.com.
enterpriseregistration  IN CNAME  enterpriseregistration.windows.net.
enterpriseenrollment    IN CNAME  enterpriseenrollment-s.manage.microsoft.com.

; ---- mail: DMARC ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
_dmarc                  IN TXT    "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; adkim=r; aspf=r; rua=mailto:dmarc_rua@onsecureserver.net;"

; ---- mail: Amazon SES custom MAIL FROM (live values, ap-south-1 = the region the platform uses)
mail                    IN MX     10 feedback-smtp.ap-south-1.amazonses.com.
mail                    IN TXT    "v=spf1 include:amazonses.com ~all"

; ---- mail: Amazon SES DKIM, ap-south-2 identity (from dns-records.csv; all three live today) ---
n3w6og5dsxwnpwph46lvmxw4ihdr56me._domainkey IN CNAME n3w6og5dsxwnpwph46lvmxw4ihdr56me.dkim.ap-south-2.amazonses.com.
afdw4hbnfoj35nztp74wu4nl4oisiu3a._domainkey IN CNAME afdw4hbnfoj35nztp74wu4nl4oisiu3a.dkim.ap-south-2.amazonses.com.
fvp6x7tod5smdgxixmetivb24zcbapar._domainkey IN CNAME fvp6x7tod5smdgxixmetivb24zcbapar.dkim.ap-south-2.amazonses.com.

; MISSING - must come from the GoDaddy export before import:
;   * the three SES DKIM CNAMEs of the ap-south-1 (Mumbai) identity the platform sends from;
;   * any other _domainkey, _amazonses, _acme-challenge, SRV, CAA or other hidden-name records.

